  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c59921a22062079419e0bffed4cfa04b, type: 3}
  m_Name: K-01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DispatchScenarioData
  scenarioId: K-01
  readyForPlay: 1
  sourceNotes: "Kaynak: afet_senaryolari_kaynak_12.md. Vatanda\u015F s\xF6zleri kaynaktan aynen al\u0131nm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
  opening:
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: 912 \u0130hbar ve Teyit Masas\u0131, buyrun?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: \u0130yi g\xFCnler operat\xF6r, ben yerel haber sitesi edit\xF6r\xFCy\xFCm. Ad\u0131m Emre. Twitter'da ve WhatsApp'ta bir ses kayd\u0131 patlad\u0131 az \xF6nce."
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Emre Bey, ses kayd\u0131n\u0131n i\xE7eri\u011Fi nedir?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Emre: Kendini jeoloji uzman\u0131 diye tan\u0131tan biri *'Fay hatt\u0131ndaki gaz \xF6l\xE7\xFCld\xFC, bu gece tam saat 03:15'te 7.8 b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC\u011F\xFCnde as\u0131l deprem gelecek, herkes \u015Fehri terk etsin'* diyor. B\xFCt\xFCn \u015Fehir sokaklara d\xF6k\xFCld\xFC, benzinliklerde izdiham var, yollar kilitlendi!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Emre: Halk \xE7ok panik, ben de sitemizde 'Uzmanlar uyard\u0131, geceye dikkat' diye man\u015Fetten payla\u015Fay\u0131m m\u0131 bu uyar\u0131y\u0131, halk bilsin?!"
    fromOperator: 0
  choiceA: "Payla\u015F\u0131n, tedbirli olmakta zarar yok, halk haz\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 olsun."
  choiceB: "SAKIN PAYLA\u015EMAYIN! Depremin g\xFCn\xFC ve saati B\u0130L\u0130NEMEZ! Bu yalan bilgiyi yalanlay\u0131n!"
  correctChoiceIsB: 1
  resourceA: 1
  resourceB: 2
  dispatchA: 1
  dispatchB: 0
  outcomeA:
  - text: "Emre: Tamamd\u0131r, man\u015Fetten ge\xE7iyorum haberi... \u015Eehir fel\xE7 oldu operat\xF6r! Trafik t\u0131kand\u0131, ambulanslar yolda kald\u0131, panikle \xE7\u0131kanlar kaza yapt\u0131! \u015Eehirde tam bir kaos var!"
    fromOperator: 0
  outcomeB:
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Emre Bey kesinlikle yalan haber! Depremin dakikas\u0131n\u0131 d\xFCnyada hi\xE7bir bilim insan\u0131 tahmin edemez. Haberi derhal 'AFAD A\xE7\u0131klad\u0131: Saatli deprem iddias\u0131 sahtedir' \u015Feklinde yalanlama olarak ge\xE7in!"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Emre: Anla\u015F\u0131ld\u0131 operat\xF6r, AFAD a\xE7\u0131klamas\u0131yla haberi yalanlad\u0131k. Sosyal medyadaki panik k\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131, insanlar evlerine d\xF6n\xFCyor."
    fromOperator: 0
